meta {
  name: Add Emergency Contact (HR)
  type: http
  seq: 122
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/hr/employees/{{userId}}/contacts
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Sunita Mohan",
    "relation": "Mother",
    "phone": "+91 98100 11122",
    "is_primary": true
  }
}

docs {
  Admin -> Team -> Edit (hr.employees.manage). Service transaction after the capability
  check, fenced to the caller's org: a person outside it is 404, never 403. Editing your
  own record is 400 (use My profile). The audit row records THAT it changed, never the values.

  201 { data: { id } }. A person's first contact is primary; promoting one demotes the rest.
}
